sequenceDiagram
    participant Eng as Engineer
    participant Cmd as commands/options.md
    participant Skill as architecture SKILL.md
    participant Ref as options-mode.md
    participant Src as Template, design-system.css, corpus
    participant Report as docs/architecture/options/name/ report
    participant Val as check_options_report.py
    participant Design as design mode (/architect:design)

    Eng->>Cmd: /architect:options
    Cmd->>Skill: Dispatch architecture skill in options mode
    Skill->>Ref: Load the procedure
    Ref->>Src: Read template, stylesheet, and corpus
    Src-->>Ref: Structure, styling, and evidence
    Note over Ref: Stage 2 inquires and stage 3 proposes options.<br>No divergent exploration runs. No options.json is written.
    Ref->>Report: Write one self-contained HTML report
    Ref->>Val: Run the validator on the report
    Val->>Report: Read the HTML
    alt A check fails
        Val-->>Ref: Exit non-zero with the failed check
        Ref->>Report: Fix the report
    else All checks pass
        Val-->>Ref: Exit zero
    end
    Ref-->>Eng: Hand off the report path
    Eng->>Report: Read it and copy the decisions text
    Eng->>Design: Paste decisions text with inquiry IDs
    Note over Design: Stage 4 alone decides and fills intent.alternatives
